{
  "slug": "breezeware-dev-plugins",
  "name": "Breezeware Dev Plugins",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "True Claude Code plugins for Breezeware development — auto-detecting, hook-powered, with skills and code review.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `breezeware-code-review` (General code review for bugs, security vulnerabilities, performance issues, and style violations), `breezeware-code-review-automation` (Review Java Playwright automation test code for reliability, maintainability, locator strategy, Cucumber BDD conventions, and Breezeware standards), `breezeware-code-review-backend` (Review Spring Boot backend Java code for bugs, security, performance, and Breezeware convention violations), `breezeware-code-review-cucumber` (Review Cucumber Gherkin feature files for BDD best practices, declarative writing, tagging strategy, step reusability, scenario independence, and…), `breezeware-code-review-frontend` (Review React frontend code for bugs, security, performance, accessibility, and Breezeware convention violations), `breezeware-code-review-mobile` (Review React Native mobile code for bugs, security, performance, accessibility, and Breezeware convention violations), `breezeware-cucumber-feature` (Write production-ready Cucumber Gherkin feature files with BDD best practices, declarative steps, tagging strategy, data tables, scenario outlines,…), `breezeware-git-workflow` (Generate PR descriptions, changelogs, release notes, and commit messages following Breezeware conventions), and 5 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install breezeware-dev-plugins@claude-community` from `Breezeware-OS/breezeware-claude-plugins`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
